| Route | Role |
|---|---|
| `/`, `/style.css`, `/app.js` | the console |
| `/chat`, `/chat.css`, `/chat.js` | the chat app, if enabled |
| `/fleet`, `/fleet.css`, `/fleet.js` | the fleet app, if enabled |
| `/node`, `/node.css`, `/node.js` | the node card as a page (`/node#<id>`) |
